test.yaml:5:22: "timeout-minutes" is 60, but GitHub terminates a job on a single-CPU runner (ubuntu-slim) after 15 minutes, so the job fails at that time. set 15 or less, or use a runner with more CPUs for a job that takes longer [ubuntu-slim-limits]
test.yaml:11:5: "container" cannot be used on ubuntu-slim: ubuntu-slim runs the job inside an unprivileged container, which has no Docker daemon, so the job container cannot start. use a runner with a VM such as ubuntu-latest [ubuntu-slim-limits]
test.yaml:18:7: "services" cannot be used on ubuntu-slim: ubuntu-slim runs the job inside an unprivileged container, which has no Docker daemon, so the service containers cannot start. use a runner with a VM such as ubuntu-latest [ubuntu-slim-limits]
test.yaml:26:15: the Docker container action "docker://alpine:3.22" cannot run on ubuntu-slim: ubuntu-slim runs the job inside an unprivileged container, which has no Docker daemon. use a runner with a VM such as ubuntu-latest [ubuntu-slim-limits]
test.yaml:31:22: "timeout-minutes" is 30, but GitHub terminates a job on a single-CPU runner (ubuntu-slim) after 15 minutes, so the job fails at that time. set 15 or less, or use a runner with more CPUs for a job that takes longer [ubuntu-slim-limits]
